	(text_box "NOTES (NTSC build; PAL values in brackets)\nNumbered notes are from Commodore schematic 251138 Rev\nB; lettered notes are for this design. Boxed markers\nshow where a note applies.\n\n7. [obsolete]\n\nB. IC sockets: these chips are not sold by LCSC, so the\nboard gets a round-pin DIP socket and the chip is\nbought separately and inserted after assembly.\nU17: PLA 906114-01 or a compatible replacement (see\n    note 7)\nU1701 (SID sheet): 8580 SID. A 6581 does not work: it\n    needs 12 V on VDD.\nU504 (VIC-II sheet): 8562 VIC-II (NTSC). A 6567 does\n    not work: it needs 12 V on pin 13."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
